{"3981020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HELL THUG", "steam_appid": 3981020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Possess a Demon, Stop the Angel Forces.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your death comes as the Combo Meter depletes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fall.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There will always be more Angels to kill.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981020/extras/91f8245c482e100e0cc2ab4f5a15423d.poster.avif?t=1770146916\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981020/extras/91f8245c482e100e0cc2ab4f5a15423d.webm?t=1770146916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981020/extras/91f8245c482e100e0cc2ab4f5a15423d.mp4?t=1770146916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a geek devil. You've received a possession file that can access and take control of the nervous system of an Automatic Infernal Defense Unit (<strong>AIDU</strong>). For <strong>AIDU</strong>, the only way to survive is to absorb the soul essence from the Angel Forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double Jump, Slide, Back Slide, Slam, Dash, Dash Jump,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, Charge Shoot, Reload Parry, Counter,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>AND KILL.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain your movesets, land your bullets, and <strong>Fall</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra Fast Paced, Character-Action, Free-Fall Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never-Ending, Ever-Changing Vertical Levels without any loading screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various Upgrades for your Gun and Character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Different Unique Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 Types of Unique Enemies</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Possess a Demon, Stop the Angel Forces.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your death comes as the Combo Meter depletes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fall.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There will always be more Angels to kill.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981020/extras/91f8245c482e100e0cc2ab4f5a15423d.poster.avif?t=1770146916\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981020/extras/91f8245c482e100e0cc2ab4f5a15423d.webm?t=1770146916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981020/extras/91f8245c482e100e0cc2ab4f5a15423d.mp4?t=1770146916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a geek devil. You've received a possession file that can access and take control of the nervous system of an Automatic Infernal Defense Unit (<strong>AIDU</strong>). For <strong>AIDU</strong>, the only way to survive is to absorb the soul essence from the Angel Forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double Jump, Slide, Back Slide, Slam, Dash, Dash Jump,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, Charge Shoot, Reload Parry, Counter,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>AND KILL.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain your movesets, land your bullets, and <strong>Fall</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra Fast Paced, Character-Action, Free-Fall Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never-Ending, Ever-Changing Vertical Levels without any loading screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various Upgrades for your Gun and Character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Different Unique Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 Types of Unique Enemies</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Auto-duplicating Angel Forces swarm through the never-ending Hell Rod. A tiny demon free-falls her way to the bottom, mowing angels down as her demise looms closer.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981020/42c8c112e4ef4d05acc17066b8a381745b2877b3/header.jpg?t=1770146916", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981020/e52f00c95bdc6198691018f36c5c60982ff304a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770146916", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981020/e52f00c95bdc6198691018f36c5c60982ff304a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770146916", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Bheismarque"], "publishers": ["PLEASURE GARDEN"], "demos": [{"appid": 4000130, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Ac